===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A mark made by smearing.
#: ''This detergent cleans windows without leaving '''smears'''.''
# {{context|medicine|lang=en}} A [[Pap smear]].
#: ''I'm going to the doctor's this afternoon for a '''smear'''.''
# A false [[attack]].
# {{cx|climbing|lang=en}} A [[maneuver]] in which the shoe is placed onto the [[hold]]less rock, and the friction from the shoe keeps it in contact

